---
const today = new Date();
---

<footer class="footer">
	<div class="footer-content">
		<p class="copyright">© {today.getFullYear()} 投資百科. All rights reserved.</p>
		<p class="disclaimer">本站內容僅供參考，不構成投資建議。投資有風險，請謹慎評估。</p>
	</div>
</footer>

<style>
	.footer {
		margin-top: 4rem;
		padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.1);
		text-align: center;
	}

	.footer-content {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.copyright {
		color: #94a3b8;
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.disclaimer {
		color: #64748b;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		margin: 0;
	}
</style>
